{
  "camel_example": "",
  "cmd_full_name": "dbfs list-snapshot",
  "cmd_name": "list-snapshot",
  "deprecated": false,
  "description_en": "Call ListSnapshot to query user-created DBFS snapshots",
  "description_zh": "调用ListSnapshot查询用户创建的数据库文件系统快照列表",
  "kebab_example": "aliyun dbfs list-snapshot --biz-region-id cn-hangzhou --page-number 1 --page-size 10 --sort-key SnapshotSize --sort-type desc --filter-key SnapshotId --filter-value s-bp67acfmxazb4p0000 --fs-id dbfs-GOrr00000000Yd0VLOyBpg --status accomplished --snapshot-name testSnapshotName --snapshot-type user --snapshot-ids 's-bp67acfmxazb4p0000_,_s-bp67acfmxazb5p0000_,_…_s-bp67acfmxazb6p0000' --region cn-hangzhou",
  "method": "GET|POST",
  "multi_version": false,
  "name": "ListSnapshot",
  "operation": {
    "action": "ListSnapshot",
    "api_style": "RPC",
    "api_version": "2020-04-18",
    "method": "POST",
    "operation_type": "read",
    "protocol": "HTTPS",
    "system_operation_type": "get",
    "url": ""
  },
  "parameters": [
    {
      "doc_required": true,
      "example": "cn-hangzhou",
      "help_en": "The region ID of the DBFS instance. Call DescribeRegions (https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/25609.html) to view the latest Alibaba Cloud region list",
      "help_zh": "DBFS实例所属的地域ID。您可以调用DescribeRegions (https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/25609.html)查看最新的阿里云地域列表",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "region_id",
      "options": [
        "--biz-region-id"
      ],
      "raw_name": "RegionId",
      "required": true,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "1",
      "help_en": "The current page number",
      "help_zh": "当前页码",
      "location": "query",
      "maximum": "10240",
      "minimum": "1",
      "name": "page_number",
      "options": [
        "--page-number"
      ],
      "raw_name": "PageNumber",
      "required": false,
      "type": "int"
    },
    {
      "example": "10",
      "help_en": "The number of entries per page for paged query.\n\nMaximum: 100.\n\nDefault: 10",
      "help_zh": "分页查询时设置的每页条数。\n\n最大值：100。\n\n默认值：10",
      "location": "query",
      "maximum": "200",
      "minimum": "10",
      "name": "page_size",
      "options": [
        "--page-size"
      ],
      "raw_name": "PageSize",
      "required": false,
      "type": "int"
    },
    {
      "example": "SnapshotSize",
      "help_en": "Set the sorting method for snapshots.\n\nUse with SortType. The value must be SnapshotSize or CreatedTime.\n\nSnapshotSize sorts by snapshot size. CreatedTime sorts by creation time.\n\nBy default, sort by creation time in descending order",
      "help_zh": "查询快照时设置排序方式。\n\n与SortType配合使用，取值必须为SnapshotSize或CreatedTime。\n\n取值为SnapshotSize则根据快照容量排序，取值为CreatedTime则根据创建时间排序。\n\n默认根据创建时间倒序排列",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "sort_key",
      "options": [
        "--sort-key"
      ],
      "raw_name": "SortKey",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "desc",
      "help_en": "Set the sorting method for snapshots.\n\nUse with SortKey. The value must be asc or desc.\n\nIf the value is asc, sort in ascending order. If the value is desc, sort in descending order.\n\nBy default, sort by creation time in descending order",
      "help_zh": "查询快照时设置排序方式。\n\n与SortKey配合使用，取值必须为asc或desc。\n\n取值为asc则正序排列，取值为desc则降序排列。\n\n默认根据创建时间倒序排列",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "sort_type",
      "options": [
        "--sort-type"
      ],
      "raw_name": "SortType",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "SnapshotId",
      "help_en": "The filter key for querying snapshots.\n\nUse with FilterValue. The value must be SnapshotId or SnapshotName.\n\nIf SnapshotId is passed, filter by snapshot ID. If SnapshotName is passed, filter by snapshot name",
      "help_zh": "查询快照时的筛选键。\n\n与FilterValue配合使用，取值必须为SnapshotId或SnapshotName。\n\n传入SnapshotId则根据快照ID进行筛选，传入SnapshotName则根据快照名称进行筛选",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "filter_key",
      "options": [
        "--filter-key"
      ],
      "raw_name": "FilterKey",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "s-bp67acfmxazb4p****",
      "help_en": "The filter value for querying snapshots.\n\nUse with FilterKey",
      "help_zh": "查询快照时的筛选值。\n\n与FilterKey配合使用",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "filter_value",
      "options": [
        "--filter-value"
      ],
      "raw_name": "FilterValue",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "dbfs-GOrr********Yd0VLOyBpg",
      "help_en": "The DBFS ID",
      "help_zh": "数据库文件系统ID",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "fs_id",
      "options": [
        "--fs-id"
      ],
      "raw_name": "FsId",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "accomplished",
      "help_en": "Snapshot status. Valid values:\n\nprogressing: The snapshot is being created.\n\naccomplished: The snapshot was created successfully.\n\nfailed: The snapshot failed to be created.\n\nall (default): All snapshot statuses",
      "help_zh": "快照状态。取值范围：\n\nprogressing：正在创建的快照。\n\naccomplished：创建成功的快照。\n\nfailed：创建失败的快照。\n\nall（默认）：所有快照状态",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "status",
      "options": [
        "--status"
      ],
      "raw_name": "Status",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "testSnapshotName",
      "help_en": "Snapshot name",
      "help_zh": "快照名称",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "snapshot_name",
      "options": [
        "--snapshot-name"
      ],
      "raw_name": "SnapshotName",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "user",
      "help_en": "Snapshot creation type. Currently, only manual snapshots are supported.\n\nuser: Manual snapshot.\n\nall (default): All snapshot creation types",
      "help_zh": "快照创建类型。目前仅支持手动快照。\n \nuser：手动创建快照。\n\nall（默认）：所有的快照创建类型",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "snapshot_type",
      "options": [
        "--snapshot-type"
      ],
      "raw_name": "SnapshotType",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "[\"s-bp67acfmxazb4p****\", \"s-bp67acfmxazb5p****\", … \"s-bp67acfmxazb6p****\"]",
      "help_en": "Snapshot code. The value can be a JSON array of multiple snapshot IDs. It supports a maximum of 100 IDs, separated by commas (,)",
      "help_zh": "快照标识编码。取值可以由多个快照ID组成一个JSON数组，最多支持100个ID，ID之间用半角逗号（,）隔开",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "snapshot_ids",
      "options": [
        "--snapshot-ids"
      ],
      "raw_name": "SnapshotIds",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
